id: pm-rust-otel
title: Pinned CLI installation fails on unavailable telemetry dependency versions
description: "CI run 37472610207 at 31875f2: all three Rust jobs and all three release aggregates fail during npm install -g @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.5. npm ETARGET reports no matching @opentelemetry/resources@2.12.0 or @opentelemetry/sdk-trace@2.12.0. The preceding CI run 37469869069 installed the same oracle successfully. Investigate upstream dependency resolution separately from Windows coverage fixtures."
